  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen pressing on the \"Go to Main Menu\" button in the Quick Menu Audio Tab the Main Menu Audio Settings can become cutoff if you had the Main Menu Audio Category in the Settings Tab open before. (So when you launch the game or switch back to it at a later point)\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Launch the game in Desktop (not sure if VR also has the issue)\n\n2. Open the Quick Menu and go to the Audio Tab  \n\n3. Press on the \"Go to Main Menu\" button in the top right\n\nIf you do this you will notice that you can't fully scroll down and that the \"Lock Shape Rotation\" setting is not accessible.\n\nSwitching to a different Category in the Settings Tab and back (e.g. Graphics) fixes it until you reopen it via the Quick Menu Audio Tab.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe Audio Category in the Main Menu Settings Tab should never be cutoff.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/s2f95f.mp4",
